{"id":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter4#def:real-analytic-function","title":"def:real-analytic-function","path":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter4.md","line":707,"body":"","kind":"definition","status":"not_started","tex":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter4.tex#def:real-analytic-function","uses":[],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter4.tex","label":"def:real-analytic-function","line":1052,"source":"\\begin{definition}[Real analytic function]\n\\label{def:real-analytic-function}\n\\dcref{ch4:4.6.2-def-1}\n\\group{Power Series Methods}\nA function $f:\\R^n\\to\\R$ is real analytic near $x_0$ if\n\\[\nf(x)=\\sum_\\alpha f_\\alpha(x-x_0)^\\alpha\n\\]\nfor $|x-x_0|<r$ and some $r>0$.\n\\end{definition}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Definition</div></section>[Real analytic function] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-6465663a7265616c2d616e616c797469632d66756e6374696f6e\"></span> <span class=\"tex-source-references\" role=\"list\" style=\"display:block\"><span class=\"tex-dcref\" role=\"listitem\" style=\"display:block\">1. ch4:4.6.2-def-1</span></span>\\group Power Series Methods A function <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$f:\\R ^n\\to \\R $\">$f:\\R ^n\\to \\R $</span> is real analytic near <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$x_0$\">$x_0$</span> if <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\[  f(x)=\\sum _\\alpha f_\\alpha (x-x_0)^\\alpha  \\]\">\\[  f(x)=\\sum _\\alpha f_\\alpha (x-x_0)^\\alpha  \\]</span> for <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$|x-x_0|&lt;r$\">$|x-x_0|&lt;r$</span> and some <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$r&gt;0$\">$r&gt;0$</span>. ","warnings":["部分 TeX 排版细节未完整还原（已保留可读内容）: group"]},"previous":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter4#sec:real-analy